{
    "title": "How Many - Trivia Game",
    "description": "\"How Many - Trivia Game is the ultimate brainy challenge that will leave you exposed to the world of word games and brain games! Test your IQ with mind-boggling trivia and brain tests. Unravel puzzles, stack knowledge, and embark on an offline journey of excitement!\r\n\r\nIn this challenging and fun quiz game, you'll face thousands of unique and challenging trivia questions that test your knowledge of various topics and categories. With multiple game modes, you'll be entertained for hours as you play through quizland, answering questions and trying to outdo your friends in trvia. In each round, you'll be presented with a question and a list of possible answers, and you'll have multiple ways to respond. You can try to answer the question directly by selecting one of the multiple choice options, or you can try drawing a number with your finger on the screen. The game will use image recognition technology to try to understand the number you've drawn and provide you with a corresponding answer.\r\n\r\nIf you're not sure of the correct answer, you can also try guessing. The game will keep track of how close your guess is to the correct answer, and if nobody knows the correct answer, the player with the closest guess will win the round. As you progress through the game, the questions will become more difficult, so you'll need to use all of your knowledge and problem-solving skills to get as far as possible. With features reminiscent of popular games like trivia star, hq trivia, and triviacrack, you'll feel like you're playing a round of preguntados with friends. Whether you're a trivia buff or just looking for a fun quiz to pass the time, this game has something for everyone.Compete with friends in this thrilling trivia crack and become the trivia king. Guess answers, answer funny surveys, and have fun like never before. From Scrabble to Kahoot, this game has it all! Dive into the world of jeopardy, show off your brainpower, and conquer the top ranks.\r\n\r\nGet ready for an IQ test that will buzz your brain with exhilarating quiz games. How Many brings you an unforgettable experience of word games and brain teasers. Download now and enjoy endless hours of fun!\"",
    "descriptionHTML": "&quot;How Many - Trivia Game is the ultimate brainy challenge that will leave you exposed to the world of word games and brain games! Test your IQ with mind-boggling trivia and brain tests. Unravel puzzles, stack knowledge, and embark on an offline journey of excitement!<br><br>In this challenging and fun quiz game, you&#39;ll face thousands of unique and challenging trivia questions that test your knowledge of various topics and categories. With multiple game modes, you&#39;ll be entertained for hours as you play through quizland, answering questions and trying to outdo your friends in trvia. In each round, you&#39;ll be presented with a question and a list of possible answers, and you&#39;ll have multiple ways to respond. You can try to answer the question directly by selecting one of the multiple choice options, or you can try drawing a number with your finger on the screen. The game will use image recognition technology to try to understand the number you&#39;ve drawn and provide you with a corresponding answer.<br><br>If you&#39;re not sure of the correct answer, you can also try guessing. The game will keep track of how close your guess is to the correct answer, and if nobody knows the correct answer, the player with the closest guess will win the round. As you progress through the game, the questions will become more difficult, so you&#39;ll need to use all of your knowledge and problem-solving skills to get as far as possible. With features reminiscent of popular games like trivia star, hq trivia, and triviacrack, you&#39;ll feel like you&#39;re playing a round of preguntados with friends. Whether you&#39;re a trivia buff or just looking for a fun quiz to pass the time, this game has something for everyone.Compete with friends in this thrilling trivia crack and become the trivia king. Guess answers, answer funny surveys, and have fun like never before. From Scrabble to Kahoot, this game has it all! Dive into the world of jeopardy, show off your brainpower, and conquer the top ranks.<br><br>Get ready for an IQ test that will buzz your brain with exhilarating quiz games. How Many brings you an unforgettable experience of word games and brain teasers. Download now and enjoy endless hours of fun!&quot;",
